<title>FRANCE: One ship loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>One ship loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was loading 18,500 tonnes of flour in Rouen destined for Yemen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One more ship was expected in port by May 28 to load 10,000 tonnes of flour. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
